    "The Spiky Ball is an Epic piece of Hero Equipment for the Barbarian King. It was first seen in the first level of Haaland's Challenge, and made its debut in the Clash with Haaland medal event on May 7, 2024. Since July 9, 2024, it may appear in the Trader, where it is obtainable for 1,500 Gems."
